      "role": "user",
      "content": "got it. so documentation is basically my shield. i guess what i mean is, what do i do when there's someone who is just... difficult? like they're not necessarily breaking a major rule, but they're kind of causing chaos or being disruptive to the team vibe. how do you even start a formal process for that kind of \"bad actor\" stuff?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
