      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Disruptive behavior that impacts team morale falls under performance or conduct issues, which still require clear documentation. Instead of focusing on the \"vibe,\" document specific, objective examples of the disruption, such as interruptions during meetings or missed deadlines caused by their behavior. Start with a coaching conversation focused on expected workplace conduct, rather than immediately jumping to formal warnings. This allows you to address the behavior early before it escalates into a formal disciplinary case.",
      "source": "target",
